  "full_text": "So I'm Terry Davis and God said if you made me king I had to promise to kill the vile people so the world is overpopulated and the solution is pretty obvious the Roman Catholics got it right you need a natural birth but you just need natural death so you gotta have war so anyway so we're gonna have kingdoms and this is about maybe I put my sons on some different thrones in this Little sub kingdoms or something like that and it's a song called faded glory. So It goes a little like this. Let's see. Hold on a second here. So it's about you know old glory the the flag right and It's gonna be a Roman Catholic Kingdom The Roman dome is a hoary glory that's gray hair the melted pilgrims tell the Tori story faded tongues echo constellations speckle Older true blue, better new do. Ruling class crass, union jackass. Faded tongues echo, constellation speckle. Hawking black hole, clocks are craving, raving. Spirit quenching, got the mentions wrenching. Faded tongues echo, constellation speckle. Ode to bear dance, about to cry in line. Hark a babe tattle, now a flowered coward. Faded tongues echo, constellation speckle. So I hope you enjoy my channel.",
